<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Thyssen / Krupp steel venture.</title>
<headline>EU clears Thyssen / Krupp steel venture.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said it had cleared plans by Thyssen Stahl AG and Krupp Hoesch Stahl to pool their production and sale of unalloyed flat steel products in a new joint venture called Thyssen Krupp Stahl.</p>
<p>Other activities to be transferred to the venture include the production of steel tubes and tailored blanks for the car industry. The deal was notified to the European Union executive for clearance on July 7.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
